{"title":"Blackstone","slug":"Blackstone","pageid":740,"revid":21576,"timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:33:53Z","lastEditor":"SentientSeer","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$22.5/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$15/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$20/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Blackstone spawns everywhere in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magma_Caves/\">Magma Caves</a> and commonly in the eastern savannah of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater</a>. This node has a medium range of sizes and is one of the two stones that can contain <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Obsidian/\">Obsidian</a>, the other being <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lavaslate/\">Lavaslate</a>.\n</p><p>Blackstone has a black appearance, and the darkest of all nodes in-game, even more so than <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Darkslate/\">darkslate</a>.\n</p>\n<h5 id=\"the-chart-below-displays-all-possible-ores-that-spawn-within-this-node\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</h5>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rose gold\">Rose gold</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rose_Gold/\">Rose Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Obsidianraw\">Obsidianraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Obsidian/\">Obsidian</a></td>\n<td>Unknown spawn chance<br>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Palladiumraw\">Palladiumraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Palladium/\">Palladium</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"5145d26db879fcb137abc71d230e4916\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Adurite-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Adurite.png\">Adurite.png</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Adurite.png\">Adurite.png</span></span></div></div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Adurite/\">Adurite</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Forged Blackstone perfectly resembles asphalt, as it has the asphalt color and texture.</li>\n<li>One of the very few ore holding stone nodes to not end in the \"<i>-slate</i>\" suffix.</li></ul>"}
